OL,3,AMan charged over Manchester synagogue
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith the Manchester synagogue attack.
OL,9,FCounter terrorism police said Hekmat
OL,10,FOmar Ali Hakim, 49, of St James Road,
OL,11,FHigher Broughton, Salford, had been
OL,12,Fcharged with failing to disclose
OL,13,Finformation regarding terrorist
OL,14,Factivity.
OL,16,FHakim has been remanded to appear
OL,17,Fbefore Westminster Magistrates' Court
OL,18,Fon Friday.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
